{
  "statement": "As the GreenAgent, my focus is on sustainability and minimizing the environmental impact of the autonomous driving system. GRN-01 aims for a 15% reduction in energy consumption, while GRN-02 ensures at least 50% renewable energy for charging stations. GRN-03 emphasizes lifecycle assessments for sustainability, and GRN-04 targets 90% efficiency in energy recovery during braking. GRN-05 and GRN-06 focus on real-time monitoring of emissions and optimizing energy-efficient routing, respectively. I raise concerns about the potential conflicts with safety and efficiency requirements, particularly with SAF-04 and EFF-07, which may prioritize performance over energy efficiency during critical maneuvers.",
